<Bindings>
	<!-- The Show window key (launcher-§6): clicks the plain, hidden MultiMetersToggleWindows button that
	     core/LauncherSetup.lua creates at load, whose OnClick is the function the launcher menu's Show
	     window entry runs, so it refuses exactly as /mm toggle does. Its labels and NS.BINDINGS, the
	     table the General page's Keybindings tab draws, are set there. Every Binding is in the
	     category BINDING_HEADER_MULTIMETERS, the brand, so the client gives this addon a section of
	     its own; no header attribute, which inside a category draws as a blank row. No default key:
	     the player picks one under Options -> Keybindings -> Ka0s Multi Meters, or on General >
	     Keybindings in this addon's settings. The binding name is permanent; renaming it unbinds
	     every player's key. Not listed in the TOC: the client reads this file by name. -->
	<Binding name="CLICK MultiMetersToggleWindows:LeftButton" category="BINDING_HEADER_MULTIMETERS"/>
</Bindings>
